                <pb facs="0353" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p1/pg339"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The United Nations Commission for India and Pakistan was composed of the
                    following members: <list>
                        <item>Czechoslovakia—nominated by India, February 10.</item>
                        <item>Belgium—appointed by the Council, April 23.</item>
                        <item>Colombia—appointed by the Council, April 23.</item>
                        <pb facs="0354" n="340" xml:id="pg340"/>
                        <item>Argentina—nominated by Pakistan, April 30.</item>
                        <item>United States—designated by the President of the Council, May 7, in
                            the absence of agreement between Argentina and Czechoslovakia on the
                            member to be designated by them.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
            </div>
